Package: lv2sra
Type: Package
Title: Generating SRA Submissions from LIMS Data
Version: 0.1.2
Author: Brendan J. Kelly
Maintainer: Brendan J. Kelly <brendank@upenn.edu>
Description: Converts common-format LIMS data listings into metadata appropriate for SRA biosamples (Microbe or Metagenome packages).
